    "updated_at": "2016-02-19T17:49:57Z",
    "body": "@TakayoshiKochi, do you have thoughts on this? Do you agree the Firefox/Safari behavior is more intuitive? Would Chome be willing to follow them?\n\nIf so: I know you're probably going to be working with us a lot on changes to the focus model for shadow DOM. Would you be interested in working on fixing this bug as a good starter for editing the focus model parts of HTML?\n",
